menu "K7 appliance"

config K7_TRUST_DEV_ORIGIN
    bool "Trust the development App origin as well"
    default n
    help
      A development firmware build accepts the App served at
      https://k7-dev.xperiments.dev:8000 besides the deployed one at
      https://k7.xperiments.dev: its CORS reply and its MCP origin guard
      name whichever of the two made the request.

      Turn this on only for a board you develop against. A release is built
      from the sunton variant, which leaves it off, so a shipped binary
      carries the deployed origin alone (docs/adr/0082).

endmenu
